ommit_sha":"8586c84e3b4fd9d976e522e18d4ccf794542bc61","position":"1785865181751690001-90279c60-7227-4e90-8048-98aca5d46a34"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"ed8dc669f270ecbf1b58164efeedf6a6e5cb8aada1ffbe9bd16b0cbb6d9bbb1a","event_uuid":"70036af0-20cc-4185-baf0-c5701baa9cb1","position":{"commit_sha":"8586c84e3b4fd9d976e522e18d4ccf794542bc61","position":"1785865182299133001-70036af0-20cc-4185-baf0-c5701baa9cb1"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"dd0f4fa510a37f6cb7cde69a1b746b094bddd0a1e51483492c6f88336f577620","event_uuid":"cd596b8d-b500-431d-876c-6c4e9509922e","position":{"commit_sha":"99ca68aefa8918bd7accb73ec4dbda6b6472c24a","position":"1785866325554630001-cd596b8d-b500-431d-876c-6c4e9509922e"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Split landed as Gerrit change 1382 (https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/1382). Pure mechanical move of the completion-precheck cluster (_is_live_ticket, _has_live_replacement_link, _referencing_commit_exists, _completion_precheck) into new close_precheck.py; transition_close.py 803->491 LOC, close_precheck.py 346 LOC. Moved bodies verbatim-identical to origin/main; re-export seam preserves monkeypatch targets and _referencing_commit_exists direct import. Lint+mypy clean, 483 pinned close-gate/lifecycle tests pass with zero test-file edits. Rebuilt on a fresh origin/main worktree after the crash left the WIP stranded on the wrong base (fix/1019 @ the 4522 commit). Awaiting LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1; not closing until CI is green.","timestamp":1785866325554630001}],"created_at":1785864913660718001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"0afbea94-93ed-4d03-bb51-e786b1195b0a","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"1019-e1e9-5117-4795"}],"description":"# transition_close.py is 803/800 LOC on main — the locked module-size gate fails EVERY patchset\n\n## Context / Problem\n\n`src/rebar/_commands/transition_close.py` sits at 803 LOC on current `origin/main`\n(f70e5d21 and descendants), over the locked 800-LOC hard cap in\n`.github/module-size-limit.txt`. The CI module-size gate runs on every\npatchset's tree, so every new Gerrit change based on main now gets\n`Verified -1` regardless of its own diff — observed live on change 1374\n(bug 1019's fix): `803 src/rebar/_commands/transition_close.py` was the only\ngate failure. Recent merges grew the file past the cap (a submit race let the\noverage land). This blocks all landing work until the file is split.\n\n## Approach\n\nSplit along the existing call-graph seam: the completion-PREcheck cluster —\n`_is_live_ticket`, `_has_live_replacement_link`, `_referencing_commit_exists`,\nand `_completion_precheck` — is a self-contained group (the first three are\ncalled only by `_completion_precheck` and each other; nothing else in the file\ncalls into them) of ~335 LOC. Move it verbatim into a new module\n`src/rebar/_commands/close_precheck.py` (well over the 100-LOC floor; the\nremainder of `transition_close.py` lands ~470 LOC, inside the 200-500 target).\nNo behavior change: pure move plus imports.\n\nCompatibility seams preserved exactly:\n\n- `transition_close` re-imports `_completion_precheck` and\n  `_referencing_commit_exists` (`from rebar._commands.close_precheck import\n  _completion_precheck as _completion_precheck, ...`), so\n  `close_ticket`'s call site still reads the `transition_close` module global —\n  existing tests that `monkeypatch.setattr(transition_close,\n  \"_completion_precheck\", ...)` and the direct test import\n  `from rebar._commands.transition_close import _referencing_commit_exists`\n  keep working unmodified. No test file changes are expected.\n- `sign_completion_verdict`, `close_ticket`, `_short_head` (the other\n  externally referenced names) stay where they are.\n\n## Scope\n\n- `src/rebar/_commands/close_precheck.py` — new module (the moved cluster).\n- `src/rebar/_commands/transition_close.py` — remove the moved code, add the\n  re-import.\n\n## Testing\n\nPure mechanical move — no new testable behavior, so no new tests. The move is\nverified by the existing suites that drive the moved code through both entry\npoints staying green: `tests/interfaces/lifecycle/` (close gate, attested\nsigning, idea bypass, subtree), `tests/unit/test_transition_close.py` (direct\n`_referencing_commit_exists` import), `tests/unit/test_llm_failure_matrix.py`\n+ `test_close_gate_bound_*` / `test_close_gate_step_budget_*` (direct\n`_tc._completion_precheck` calls), and `tests/unit/test_epic_bug_screen_4b54.py`.\nGate compliance is verified by `wc -l` ≤ 800 on both files and CI's own\nmodule-size gate going green on the change's patchset.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] `src/rebar/_commands/transition_close.py` is ≤ 800 LOC (target ≤ 500) —\n      checked by `wc -l` locally and the CI module-size gate passing on the\n      change's patchset.\n- [ ] the new `close_precheck.py` is ≥ 100 LOC and contains the moved cluster\n      unchanged in behavior — checked by `wc -l` and the existing close-gate\n      suites passing with zero test-file edits.\n- [ ] `monkeypatch.setattr(transition_close, \"_completion_precheck\", ...)`\n      seams and the `_referencing_commit_exists` direct import keep working —\n      checked by `tests/interfaces/lifecycle/` and\n      `tests/unit/test_transition_close.py` passing unmodified.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/transition_close.py","reason":"remove the moved precheck cluster; add compatibility re-import"},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/close_precheck.py","reason":"new module: the extracted completion-precheck cluster"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"90279c60-7227-4e90-8048-98aca5d46a34","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"74a3-1213-9898-4195","ticket_type":"bug","title":"transition_close.py 803/800: module-size gate fails all patchsets","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["162a8e7d-102c-4176-a1d8-8f81d29a4690","0afbea94-93ed-4d03-bb51-e786b1195b0a","f0739b21-b87b-4792-bf50-cfe6243a0cf3","828079ed-597a-4883-b7b0-b48d8064a81b","90279c60-7227-4e90-8048-98aca5d46a34","70036af0-20cc-4185-baf0-c5701baa9cb1","cd596b8d-b500-431d-876c-6c4e9509922e"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785866325554630002,"uuid":"fb87698d-1fff-4db6-91e2-07ff87e2f74e"}